'''Test Subject''' is a {{2|Bosses|Boss}} found in {{2|Glory}}. It has three phases, reviving twice with increasing HP and new powers.
__TOC__
<tabber>
|-|Phase 1=
{{Enemy Infobox
|Name   = Test Subject
|Image  = StS2_Test Subject.png
|Icon   = StS2 Icon TestSubjectBoss.png
|HP     = 100
|AscHP  = 111
|Powers = {{BD2|Adaptable}}, {{BD2|Enrage}} 2 ({{Asc2|9|3}})
|Debut  = Glory
|Type   = Boss
}} 
{{Power Infobox
|Name         = Adaptable
|Image        = StS2 Icon Adaptable.png
|Description  = When it would be defeated, it instead revives even stronger.
|Type         = Buff
|Stacks       = Does not stack
|BetweenTurns = Permanent
|Cap          = 
}}
{{Power Infobox
|Name         = Enrage
|Image        = StS2 Icon Enrage.png
|Description  = Whenever you play a Skill, gains X {{BD2|Strength}}.
|Type         = Buff
|Stacks       = Intensity
|BetweenTurns = Permanent
|Cap          = 
|GivesToEnemy = Strength
}}
=== Pattern ===
{{Intents Table/start|Test Subject}}
{{Intents Table/row
