|Effect = Deals (14;{{Asc2|9|16}}) damage. Applies 1 {{BD2|Vulnerable}}.
|GivesToPlayer = Vulnerable
}}
{{Intents Table/end}}
Starts with {{BD2|Adaptable}} and {{BD2|Enrage}} 2 ({{Asc2|9|3}}). Alternates between {{Int2|Test Subject|Bite}} and {{Int2|Test Subject|Skull Bash}}.

When reduced to 0 HP, {{BD2|Adaptable}} prevents death and it revives into Phase 2.

{{Clear}}

|-|Phase 2=
{{Enemy Infobox
