|Image  = StS2_Test Subject_Phase_2.png
|Icon   = StS2 Icon TestSubjectBoss.png
|HP     = 200
|AscHP  = 212
|Powers = {{BD2|Adaptable}}, {{BD2|Painful Stabs}}
|Debut  = Glory
|Type   = Boss
}} 
{{Power Infobox
