|Intent = Attack4
|Effect = Deals (10;{{Asc2|9|11}}) damage x3 (increases by 1 hit each use).
}}
{{Intents Table/end}}
Revives with 200 ({{Asc2|8|212}}) HP, gains {{BD2|Painful Stabs}} and loses {{BD2|Enrage}}. Uses {{Int2|Test Subject (Phase 2)|Multi-Claw}} every turn. {{Int2|Test Subject (Phase 2)|Multi-Claw}} starts at 3 hits and gains +1 hit each use.

When reduced to 0 HP again, it revives into Phase 3.

{{Clear}}

|-|Phase 3=
