|Description  = At the end of every other turn, gains {{BD2|Intangible}} 1.
|Type         = Buff
|Stacks       = Does not stack
|BetweenTurns = Permanent
|Cap          = 
|GivesToEnemy = Intangible
}}
{{Power Infobox|Intangible|2}}
=== Pattern ===
